<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēflŭvĭum</span></b> ,
			ii, n.
		id. (perh. only in Plin.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A flowing down, flowing off</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 18,
				29, 69, § 281</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">defluvia fontanea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 4, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A falling off</i> or <i>out</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capilli, = alopecia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 11, 46, § 163</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">29, 6, 34,
				§ 108</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 39, 94, § 230</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">22, 13, 15,
				§ 34</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
